#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_sepa_direct_debit/models/account_batch_payment.py:0
msgid ""
"You cannot generate a SEPA Direct Debit file with a required collection date "
"inferior to the sending day + the minimum pre-notification period of %"
"(prenot_days)s days.\n"
"The minimum required date should be %(minimum_date)s."
msgstr ""
"Нельзя сформировать файл прямого дебета SEPA с датой списания ранее, чем "
"дата отправки + минимальный срок предварительного уведомления в %"
"(prenot_days)s дней.\n"
"Минимально допустимая дата должна быть не ранее %(minimum_date)s."

#. module: account_sepa_direct_debit
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_sepa_direct_debit/models/account_batch_payment.py:0
msgid ""
"Your company must have a creditor identifier in order to issue SEPA Direct "
